<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Password Reset</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Password Reset</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>We have received a request to reset your password. Please use the following token to reset your password:</p>
<p><strong>{{ resetToken }}</strong></p>
<p>This token is valid for the next hour.</p>
<p>If you didn't request this reset, you can ignore this email.</p>
<p>Best regards,</p>
<p>Your Application Team</p>
</body>
</html>
